Bundled Mandarin and English speech recognition
X-ASR-zh-en bilingual Zipformer transducer by GilgameshWind

The upstream pretrained model is published under the Apache License, Version
2.0. See LICENSE and the pinned upstream sources for provenance:
https://huggingface.co/GilgameshWind/X-ASR-zh-en/tree/689ff18c584d29910da37b6fe904db0c1489c9d1
https://github.com/Gilgamesh-J/X-ASR/tree/838297cd47fed858e6cf72eaf5a52f948a3edd73

Sherpa-ONNX published the converted and INT8-quantized model here:
https://huggingface.co/csukuangfj2/sherpa-onnx-x-asr-zipformer-transducer-zh-en-int8-2026-06-03/tree/bbc3ebbf8f134848f804967f3a3b69f981308a85

The decoder, joiner and vocabulary are unmodified. The bundled encoder uses
ONNX external data so the graph and weights can be stored in files below 80 MB.
The published encoder's tensor bytes and graph operations are unchanged.
See scripts/local-speech/split-asr-model.py. Sherpa-ONNX reads the graph and both
weight files directly from this directory. All files ship in the standard package.

